2026-10-18T17:56:14.9394673Z -- v4.0.5 — DHW conservation: a cold tank cannot pour hot water
2026-10-18T17:56:14.9394768Z   ok   the booked draw never exceeds the nominal demand
2026-10-18T17:56:14.9394875Z   ok   every step balances: in == out + losses + storage delta
2026-10-18T17:56:14.9395037Z   ok   the inlet floor fabricated nothing — the scaled draw makes it inert
2026-10-18T17:56:14.9395154Z   ok   a cold tank delivers less than the nominal demand, not the same
2026-10-18T17:56:14.9395268Z   ok   and the tank never pins to the inlet pouring imaginary heat
2026-10-18T17:56:14.9395376Z   ok   a tank at the setpoint is debited exactly the nominal draw
2026-10-18T17:56:14.9395503Z   ok   charging cannot pass the tank rating, and the excess is booked
2026-10-18T17:56:14.9395634Z   ok   a tank read above the rating cools at its physical rate, not by fiat
2026-10-18T17:56:14.9395763Z   ok   an inlet above the tank's surroundings manufactures no heat over 24 h
